Sure! Those latitude/longitude values point to the **Googleplex** in Mountain View, California.  
Below is a quick example of how you would use the Google Geocoding API to confirm that and retrieve the full address.

---

## 1. Reverse‑Geocode Request

```http
GET https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/geocode/json
    ?latlng=37.4224764,-122.0842499
    &key=YOUR_API_KEY
```

> **Replace `YOUR_API_KEY`** with your actual Google Maps API key.

---

