- **API Call**: `https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/geocode/json?latlng=37.4224764,-122.0842499&key=YOUR_API_KEY`

Feel free to replace the placeholder API key with your own and run the request to see the live response. If you need help setting up the key or interpreting other fields, just let me know!
